## What you need

<row>
  <text>
    ### Flour

    500 g, bread flour if you can.
  </text>
  <text>
    ### Water

    375 g, lukewarm.
  </text>
  <text>
    ### Starter

    100 g, bubbly and fed 6 hours ago.
  </text>
</row>

<row>
  <text>
    ### Salt

    10 g.
  </text>
  <text>
    ### A pot

    A heavy lidded pot that goes in the oven.
  </text>
  <text>
    ### Patience

    Most of the work is waiting.
  </text>
</row>
